fn putDouble(outp:[*]u8,off:usize,x:f64) void{const bits=@as(u64,@bitCast(x));for(0..8)|k|{outp[off+k]=@truncate(bits>>(8*k));}}
export fn nesterov_accelerated_sgd(v:[*]const i64,n:usize,outp:[*]u8,cap:usize)i64{if(n<4)return -1;const wi=v[0];const si=v[1];const lm=v[2];const mm=v[3];if(wi<1 or wi>8 or si<1 or si>8 or lm<0 or lm>1000 or mm<0 or mm>1000 or n!=@as(usize,@intCast(4+wi*(si+1))))return -1;const w:usize=@intCast(wi);const s:usize=@intCast(si);for(4..n)|i|{if(v[i]<-10000 or v[i]>10000)return -1;}if(cap<w*8)return -2;var p=[_]f64{0}**8;var vel=[_]f64{0}**8;const lr=@as(f64,@floatFromInt(lm))/1000.0;const m=@as(f64,@floatFromInt(mm))/1000.0;for(0..w)|i|{p[i]=@as(f64,@floatFromInt(v[4+i]))/1000.0;}for(0..s)|t|{for(0..w)|i|{const prev=vel[i];const g=@as(f64,@floatFromInt(v[4+w+t*w+i]))/1000.0;vel[i]=m*vel[i]-lr*g;p[i]=p[i]-m*prev+(1.0+m)*vel[i];}}for(0..w)|i|{putDouble(outp,i*8,p[i]);}return @intCast(w*8);}

